      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i feel like i’m just walking through a movie or something. like i’m looking at everyone in traffic or in stores and they’re all so... loud and real. but i’m just watching them. it’s like i didn't actually come back from where i was. i’m just a ghost haunting my own life.",
